
- HypTools.py : Tools to combine/create reweighted signal hypotheses, perform signal model checks and build EFT analysis

- ACCheck.py : Full check of AC signal MC + reweighting - Requires ACconfig as input (and mkshapes output of course)

  python ../../python/ACCheck.py ACconfig.py

- EFTAna.py : Go from mkshapes output to EFT analysis datacards - Requires EFTconfig as input (and mkshapes output of course)

  python ../../PrepEFTAna.py EFTconfig.py 

- ConvertToComb.py : convert model to combine format

  python ConvertToComb.py Fai  > HWWSMEFTFai.py
  python ConvertToComb.py ciHB > HWWSMEFTciHB.py
  python ConvertToComb.py ciWB > HWWSMEFTciWB.py

################# JHUGen needed for analysis (in mkshapesRDF directory) ####

