  -> Can also share mine, clean and run setup again

################ Htt (tautau) treatment #################

  - In ggF, VBF and VH channels, main HWW signal completely dominates Htt contribution
  -> Treat Htt as background or minor signal (Should have no effect either way, easier to treat as background)

  - Seems not to be the case in ZH(4l) and 1 jet(Boosted) channels where ZH(Htt) can be relatively significant
  - Maybe production based KDs are same for HWW and Htt
  -> Assume dominant effect at production vertex and scale EFT templates by #HWW+Htt/#HWW, Or build Htt signal model (AC Htt samples)

################ ggZH ######################

  - In run 2 analysis qqbar ZH production dominated ggZH in VH channel (same in run 3?)
  - JHUGen studies imply ggZH trianlge diagrams not sensitive to a2 and a3 type couplings (just a1 and k1)
  - Box diagrams (dominant) not sensitive to HVV AC at all 
  -> Well motivated to treat as minor signal (Not EFT signal)

############## Systematic treament ###########

  - Fair to assume Higgs is at least SM-like (Looking for small deviations from SM expectation)
  -> Calculating systematics for SM Higgs and applying to all EFT templates is well motivated

